  {
    "uuid": "0e151071-4355-5139-97c5-b4331f41450b",
    "entry": "自色",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "じしょく",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "characteristic colour of a pure mineral (color)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "鉱物の粉末にして条痕色を確認したが、やはりこの石の自色は深い青色だった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "宝石の鑑定では、不純物による着色ではなく、結晶そのものの構造に由来する自色が重視される。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "顕微鏡で見ると、その薄片は岩石本来の自色とは異なる複雑な輝きを放っていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "芸妓達は各自色々な事を訊いたり、喋舌つたりした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "茶話",
                "author": "大正六（一九一七）年",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
